 "titulo": "This airport sank eight meters 🛬 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "AN AIRPORT THAT SINKS",
 "descripcion": "Kansai Airport sits on an artificial island in Osaka Bay, on top of soft clay. By 1999 it had sunk 8.2 meters.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#engineering #japan #airport #howitworks #shorts",
